      "dcterms:description": "Tick-borne encephalitis virus (TBEV), subtype TBEV-Eu, divergent strain Salland (the Netherlands) rescued and cultured on BHK-21 cells as described in Hoornweg et al., Sci Rep. 2023 Feb 18;13(1):2872. doi: 10.1038/s41598-023-29075-0  (https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-023-29075-0). \r\nThis strain is preserved in viral storage medium -80°C.",
