      "dcterms:modified": "2024-04-11T17:43:55+02:00",
      "dcterms:title": "Viral indexing of fourteen plant samples by high-throughput sequencing (HTS) (14 samples)",
      "dcterms:description": "The service offers to partners a reliable, sensitive and exhaustive technology to detect all viruses infecting plant samples, in particular for the identification of the viruses involved in novel diseases or in syndrome of unknown etiology. The service provides counseling and costing on projects, receives the samples, performs the extraction of nucleic acids. High-throughput sequencing is outsourced to a subcontractor and the platform performs the downstream bioinformatic analysis, up to the identification of known or novel viral agents present in the samples analyzed.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "Analysis of fourteen plant samples: extraction of nucleic acids, HTS (outsourced), bioinformatic analysis, up to the identification of known or novel viral agents",
