      "search:sku": "006V-05595",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-BA51/2023- Omicron VOC FY.5",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in September 2023. The virus belongs to the FY.5 lineage (Alias of XBB.1.22.1.5; Omicron VOC). The virus is preserved in Viral Storage Medium (-80 °C). Tests for the presence of mycoplasma were negative. To confirm its identity, the virus has been fully sequenced.",
