      "dcterms:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in April 2022. The virus belongs to the BA.2.38 lineage (Omicron VOC). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
